228:  /** 현재 소켓을 버리고 락을 다시 읽어 접속·재구독한다(동시 호출은 하나로 합친다). */
229:  reconnect(): Promise<void> {
230:    if (this.reconnecting) return this.reconnecting;
231:    const old = this.ws;
232:    this.ws = undefined;
233:    this.connected = false;
234:    if (old) {
235:      try {
236:        old.terminate();
237:      } catch {
238:        /* ignore */
239:      }
240:    }
241:    this.reconnecting = this.open().finally(() => {
242:      this.reconnecting = undefined;
243:    });
244:    return this.reconnecting;
245:  }
